<title>USA: Maxim Group files to sell 3.6 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Maxim Group files to sell 3.6 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>KENNESAW, Ga. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxim Group Inc said Tuesday it has filed to sell 3.6 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Of the shares being offered, 3,175,773 are being issued and sold by the company. The balance, 424,227 shares, are being sold by certain shareholders.</p>
<p>The proceeds are to be used to reduce amounts oustanding under the company's credit facilities, it said.</p>
<p>Maxim operates and franchises a retail floor covering network.</p>
